      <rules>
        <rule name="Wrathful Wanderer" id="aa455c73-821d-4335-938a-8a2a9faa6a84" hidden="false">
          <description>Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 6 inches of a battlefield edge and more than 9 inches from all enemy units.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Source notes" id="b632a777-d45d-4e17-bebc-8a7767197af9" hidden="false">
          <description>Ward 6+; move not stated. Fire rune hammers: 5 attacks, 3+/3+, Rend 2, Damage 2, +1 Damage on charge.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Alone but Never Outnumbered" id="2280da07-094c-4b99-a824-3cc9dc563d91" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit has Strike-First while there are no other friendly units within 6 inches of it.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Relentless Wrath" id="20e315e6-1a3f-4a79-b66c-5bf8daa5be16" hidden="false">
          <description>If this unit has any grudge marks and is not in combat, it can move D6 inches. It can move through enemy combat ranges but cannot end in combat, and cannot end any further than the closest enemy unit (caption wording unclear).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
