      <rules>
        <rule name="Duty Unto Death" id="adca0001-f632-41ea-b583-5758c0e85b2e" hidden="false">
          <description>While any friendly Grimdron infantry heroes are wholly within this unit’s combat range, both this unit and those heroes have a 5+ ward save.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Source notes" id="8f0be452-9af3-4873-adbc-452a0f415ea2" hidden="false">
          <description>5 models, reinforceable to 10; ward 6+. Melee 2 attacks, 3+/3+, Rend 1, Damage 2.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Fury of Grimnir" id="f0144aaf-f491-45f3-8656-8178170323f9" hidden="false">
          <description>If this unit has any grudge marks and is not in combat, it can move D6 inches. It can move through enemy combat ranges but cannot end in combat, and cannot end any further than the closest enemy unit (caption wording unclear).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
