      <rules>
        <rule name="Vulcatrix’s Fury" id="93b40748-f2fe-4f08-9a21-c6b23725c195" hidden="false">
          <description>While this unit has any grudge marks, add 1 to Attacks of companion weapons used by visible friendly Khazalite Holds units wholly within 12 inches of this unit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Source notes" id="bbb827a9-96f1-4999-9521-1b6bef0f9aaa" hidden="false">
          <description>Two-model hero unit. Omir weapon: 5 attacks, Damage 2; Ashtongue weapon: 3 attacks, Damage 2; other profile values unclear.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Dro-master at Heart" id="ed109695-80d9-49d6-9231-632185bdecd7" hidden="false">
          <description>Pick a visible friendly Vulkyn Flameseekers unit or Grimdron Monster unit wholly within 12 inches. If Flameseekers, until the start of your next turn the target ignores negative modifiers to hit and wound rolls for combat attacks and to its control score. If a Grimdron Monster, until the start of your next turn add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made with its companion weapons.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Smoke and Ash" id="310b75e6-e7ec-40d9-a0db-a0fdaa83c8cc" hidden="false">
          <description>Pick a visible enemy unit within 9 inches and roll a die. On 3+, until the start of your next turn friendly and enemy units, terrain features and manifestations are not visible to the target while they are more than 6 inches from it. Captions slightly garbled.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
